{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"平\",\n    \"core\": \"Y\",\n    \"concise\": \"平\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：X 的高亮短语虽然是碎片，但按屏幕顺序串起来，能具体看到靠近、克制、试探、害怕失去和重新投入的变化；Y 的大块虽然完整，却有不少抽象概括，情绪重点不够鲜明。small、concise：两版小字都有有用的感受补充，也都有部分重复或偏音乐描写的内容，难分高下；X 多次重复对方没有退开，Y 则反复讲无法保证亲密持续，虽然都有推进，但也都有回环。core、human、fine、load：core 选 Y，因为 S13 明确从担心失去推进到实际无法继续，S14 又把曾经的幸福与失去的痛楚并置，更准确地落在指定核心上。human 选 X，Y 的“提前削弱感受”“没有变成我能保证的结果”等表达偏书面、抽象，X 的日常口语更自然；fine 选 X，其白天相处愉快、独处时泛酸、话到喉咙口发紧等体验更具体、有辨识度；load 选 X，高亮短语比 Y 连续出现的长大块更容易在相应停留时间内扫读。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4132f0ea-deef-4f8f-9743-a7ee9ee69236", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T151219540812Z", "elapsed_seconds": 254.204, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T15:16:33.740887+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b67403261d1ef343e1f2bbb199c55ff1603072f44c0dbbc9c088c808fdc00733", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd